WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.146
Four small tools.

00:00:01.146 --> 00:00:04.855
Rewrite helps you turn rough notes into your own words.

00:00:04.855 --> 00:00:08.091
Home Base is where family notes and tips appear.

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:13.890
Settings controls alerts and quiet hours, so the app stays silent when you want it to.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:16.452
Print makes a paper copy of your week.

00:00:16.452 --> 00:00:18.678
Try it now: set your quiet hours.

